      "writtenOn": "2022-12-15T04:09:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Curious : why NOT_VCN_MANAGED ? I guess if we ever have a VPN that\u0027s VCN-managed we won\u0027t want to use it by default, so it\u0027s good I think.\n\nBut more importantly, why not NOT_RESTRICTED ? I don\u0027t think we\u0027ll have restricted VPNs any time soon, but if we do I think we should not select them as the default network for these UIDs. Remember, making the network the default for these UIDs will give the UIDs permission to access the network even if they don\u0027t have USE_RESTRICTED_NETWORK.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1631,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 1631,
        "endChar": 61
